# template's model: `stakeOnCell` reads a per-cell `totalStake`, and `roundStep`
# was shaped around a token reserve and a board of cells.
#
# It also held a `stakeAnAvatar` written against THIS game (buy an avatar
# through the setup gate, then wait for it to be in custody). That walk is
# deleted with the rest ON PURPOSE: it was never once executed green, because
